{"actor": {"model": null, "profile": null, "role": "reviewer", "tool": "claude"}, "at": "2026-10-13T20:21:16.124681+00:00", "event_id": "01M4VETBPW5V1X5BX5Z08JVPT6", "evidence": {"review": {"reference": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP03-glossary-index-name-and-prune/review-cycle-2.md", "reviewer": "claude", "verdict": "approved"}}, "execution_mode": "worktree", "force": false, "from_lane": "in_review", "mission_id": "01M4VB0NPEBCH4163JZ3RE252K", "mission_slug": "generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N", "policy_metadata": {"lane_head": "f4bdae1aa08b52ad505d369a3df7da08c47441d8", "model": null, "profile": null, "tool": "Stijn Dejongh"}, "reason": "Review passed (cycle 2, 8ac1f74): path-separator hole closed - '../x' and 20+ bypass variants either throw with the tree byte-unchanged or stay inside glossary/ and the context folders; validation precedes mkdir; prune scans only glossaryDir and each current context dir, non-recursive, four conditions intact; symlink at a target stops the run. Five reverts red (key-set, prune, stop-on-any-target via codegen-guard, validation call, lstat->existsSync). 50 tests green in the four suites; example glossary regenerates byte-identical; tsc 31 pre-existing, none in touched files. Non-blocking follow-ups: (MINOR) a symlinked glossary/ or context DIRECTORY is still written and pruned through (exact-key pages only) - lstat the directories and stop; (MINOR) glossary name rule is stricter than Gherkin validateIndexBasenames (also rejects surrounding whitespace and NUL) - share one validator; (NOTE) zero-context glossary returns before validation; over-long name surfaces raw ENAMETOOLONG.", "review_ref": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP03-glossary-index-name-and-prune/review-cycle-2.md", "review_result": {"feedback_path": "/home/stijn/Documents/_code/SDD/fork/doc-kitty/.worktrees/generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N-coord/kitty-specs/generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M