{"actor": {"model": null, "profile": null, "role": "reviewer", "tool": "claude"}, "at": "2026-10-13T20:23:35.909236+00:00", "event_id": "01M4VEYM75VFA1G6E74S4CMYYT", "evidence": {"review": {"reference": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP05-check-links-agrees-with-build/review-cycle-2.md", "reviewer": "claude", "verdict": "approved"}}, "execution_mode": "worktree", "force": false, "from_lane": "in_review", "mission_id": "01M4VB0NPEBCH4163JZ3RE252K", "mission_slug": "generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N", "policy_metadata": {"lane_head": "93828affa2b67b524d0da7ed78f53c26efea8ed7", "model": null, "profile": null, "tool": "Stijn Dejongh"}, "reason": "Review passed (cycle 2, commit 4990375): B1/M1/m1-m5 resolved. Gates exit 0 with 1084 refs, drafts on and off; consumer fixture exit 0 plain and --strict, both ways. Out-of-map edits (routeOfSlug index->/, unpublishedDraftPaths 3rd param + root exemption) match the loader and are output-neutral for docs, example/docs and the consumer fixture under all four index settings. All five requested reverts go red. Minor, non-blocking: (1) 'lets a draft page link to another draft' is now inert, it needs --strict; (2) no test fails when unpublishedDraftPaths ignores its indexBasename argument; (3) directory/extensionless draft check (resolvesToDraft) still matches index names case-sensitively: g/Readme.md draft + ./g/ passes on a strict root with drafts off; (4) --help first line says 'exactly when the build would rewrite it', which holds on strict roots only. Cross-package for WP01/WP04: Starlight slugToParam also strips a trailing /index, so a non-index or demoted x/index.md is served at /x/, while the table says /x/index/ (pre-existing WP01 rule, pinned again in the new route-table case); root README.md + root index.md both map to / with no collision under a README-only setting.", "review_ref": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP05-check-links-agrees-with-build/review-cycle-2.md", "review_result": {"feedback_path": "/home/stijn/Documents/_code/SDD/fork/doc-kitty/.worktrees/generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N-coord/kitty-specs/generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/tasks/WP05-check-links-agrees-with-build/review-cycle-2.md", "reference": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP05-check-links-agrees-with-build/review-cycle-2.md", "reviewer": "claude", "verdict": "approved"}, "to_lane": "approved", "wp_id": "WP05"}
