{"actor": {"model": null, "profile": null, "role": "reviewer", "tool": "claude"}, "at": "2026-10-13T20:45:16.720252+00:00", "event_id": "01M4VG6AHG2NPRTN8DVTK5RFSE", "evidence": {"review": {"reference": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP04-relative-md-link-rewrite/review-cycle-2.md", "reviewer": "claude", "verdict": "approved"}}, "execution_mode": "worktree", "force": false, "from_lane": "in_review", "mission_id": "01M4VB0NPEBCH4163JZ3RE252K", "mission_slug": "generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N", "policy_metadata": {"lane_head": "56f6a2542cae3ef55f16b61037501a95d290d921", "model": null, "profile": null, "tool": "Stijn Dejongh"}, "reason": "Review passed (cycle 2): draftRoutesOf no longer lists a route a published file shares (cases a/b/c/root verified; real trees byte-identical before/after for draft routes, route table, unpublished paths); 10 test files 289 green; mutations red for the shared-route rule and both hook index-name wirings; tsc 29 pre-existing, none in added lines. Follow-up (minor, not blocking): x/README.md draft + x/index.md published -> /x/ correctly not a draft route, but unpublishedDirs is derived from routes, so the draft README's title still labels the sidebar group with drafts off (config.ts:1619, routeShapingSource); derive unpublishedDirs from draft index files. Root skip in draftRoutesOf is not pinned by route-table/draft-publication tests. Implementer's statement that a status-less page is not a draft is false (isDraftStatus: missing = draft); the test marks the root explicitly draft so its assertions hold.", "review_ref": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP04-relative-md-link-rewrite/review-cycle-2.md", "review_result": {"feedback_path": "/home/stijn/Documents/_code/SDD/fork/doc-kitty/.worktrees/generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N-coord/kitty-specs/generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/tasks/WP04-relative-md-link-rewrite/review-cycle-2.md", "reference": "review-cycle://generated-page-and-link-integrity-01M4VB0N/WP04-relative-md-link-rewrite/review-cycle-2.md", "reviewer": "claude", "verdict": "approved"}, "to_lane": "approved", "wp_id": "WP04"}
